{# STUB: owned by WS5, replace #}
{#- The homepage hero MEDIA slot (CEO ruling: two modes from data, "ramp" is the default; art
    direction 2.2 to 2.4). WS5 owns the hero layout and copy; this file is only the slot contract,
    so swapping the storefront photo and the Light Ramp is one slot, not a redesign (HF3).

    Data (the page sets one object named hero, for example from pages.home in index.11tydata.js):
      hero = {
        mode:    "ramp" | "storefront"   missing or anything else = "ramp"
        image:   one _data/images.json item (storefront mode only; without it the slot falls back
                 to the ramp, so a missing photo never ships an empty box)
        alt:     alt text for the storefront photo (required in storefront mode)
        sizes:   sizes for the <img> AND the preload, identical (engineering 3.9)
        note:    optional 13px line under the media (the ramp's honesty line, art direction HF1)
      }
    Layout behavior (layouts/v3.njk): body gets class hero-ramp or hero-storefront, and in
    storefront mode with an image the head gets the one image preload with the same sizes.

    Import and call:
      {% from "v3/hero.njk" import heroMedia with context %}
      {{ heroMedia(hero, { strip: false }) }}
    opts.strip  true renders the ramp as the 120px phone strip (HF2) -#}
{% macro heroMedia(h, opts) -%}
{%- from "v3/media.njk" import picture -%}
{%- set o = opts or {} -%}
{%- set hh = h or {} -%}
{%- set isStore = (hh.mode == "storefront" and hh.image) -%}
{%- if isStore %}
<figure class="v3-hero-media v3-hero-media--storefront" data-hero-mode="storefront">
  {{ picture(hh.image, hh.sizes or "100vw", { alt: hh.alt, high: true }) }}
{%- if hh.note %}
  <figcaption class="v3-hero-media__note">{{ hh.note | safe }}</figcaption>
{%- endif %}
</figure>
{%- else %}
<figure class="v3-hero-media v3-hero-media--ramp" data-hero-mode="ramp">
  <div class="v3-ramp{% if o.strip %} v3-ramp--strip{% endif %}" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
{%- if hh.note %}
  <figcaption class="v3-hero-media__note">{{ hh.note | safe }}</figcaption>
{%- endif %}
</figure>
{%- endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
